"stake, requestUnstake, cancelUnstake, withdraw and claim act only on the calling wallet's own account; notifyReward only adds ETH. The other {0} functions only read. Blockscout lists all {1}.":"stake, requestUnstake, cancelUnstake, withdraw dan claim hanya bekerja pada akun milik wallet yang memanggilnya; notifyReward hanya menambah ETH. {0} fungsi lainnya hanya membaca. Blockscout menampilkan semua {1} fungsi.",
